<div class="daylight-legend"><span class="label"><span class="daylight-indicator good"></span>Good light</span><span class="label"><span class="daylight-indicator limited"></span>Usable</span><span class="label"><span class="daylight-indicator poor"></span>Limited</span><span class="label"><span class="daylight-indicator na"></span>No daylight</span></div>
